{"type":"message","id":"deeba68a","parentId":"f9d40c77","timestamp":"2026-05-29T00:12:51.092Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so adding a skill in OpenClaw is straightforward. There are two main methods:\n\n1. **Built-in skills**: They already exist at `/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/` and are available based on description matching. So the user doesn't need to \"install\" them per se - the system already has many available.\n\n2. **Custom/third-party skills**: Place them in `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/` directory. Each skill is a folder with a `SKILL.md` file.\n\n3. **ClawHub marketplace**: Browse at https://clawhub.com for community skills.\n\nThe key thing is that the \"skip\" the user mentioned during registration was probably about picking initial skills during setup. But the built-in ones are already there - they just auto-activate based on the description matching the user's request.\n\nLet me explain this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"其实很简单——两种方式：\n\n**1. 内置 skills 已经在系统里了**\n`/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/` 下面有一大堆现成的，天气、GitHub、Spotify、Notion、健康检查……五十多个。它们会根据你说的内容自动匹配激活，不用手动装。\n\n**2. 从 ClawHub 下载社区 skill**\n去 [clawhub.com](https://clawhub.com) 找，下载后把文件夹丢到 `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/` 就行，重启网关生效。\n\n**3. 自己写一个**\n建个目录，放个 `SKILL.md`，写清楚什么时候触发、怎么用，搞定。\n\n你当时 skip 的只是初始设置向导里的勾选，但其实内置那些一直都在，该用的时候就会用上 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":114,"output":557,"cacheRead":51584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780013563404}}
