{"type":"message","id":"4c5655a5","parentId":"4dea244b","timestamp":"2026-05-29T00:14:48.362Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what new skills I think would be useful to add. Let me think about what we do and what might be missing.\n\nCurrently we have:\n- Crypto monitoring and trading (custom scripts)\n- Reminder scheduler (custom)\n- Feishu integration\n- Memory/logging\n\nLooking at our current workflow and needs, what might be useful:\n\n1. **GitHub skill** - Already in the built-in list. Could be useful since we have a repo (Morgan) and need to push code. Might help with automating git operations.\n\n2. **Notion/note-taking skill** - If the user uses Notion for notes.\n\n3. **Spotify-player** - If the user wants music control.\n\n4. **weather** - Already available, could be useful for daily reports.\n\n5. **summarize** - Could summarize long content.\n\n6. **session-logs** - Already available for session management.\n\nBut actually, our custom scripts already handle the crypto stuff. The question is what NEW functionality would add value.\n\nLet me think about what's missing based on our context:\n- We have crypto monitoring covered with custom scripts\n- We have reminder scheduling covered\n- We have feishu integration\n- We have health/heartbeat\n\nWhat might be genuinely useful:\n- Something for code/development help (but I can already do that)\n- Something for reading/managing academic stuff (since the user is a student)\n- Something for tracking tasks/todos\n\nI think rather than picking from existing skills, I should suggest what would genuinely add value. Given the user is:\n1. A student who likes Java\n2. A crypto trader on testnet\n3. Has a GitHub repo for this project\n\nI think:\n- If he uses Notion or Apple Notes, those skills might help\n- But honestly, since I can already execute commands and read/write files, most things can be done without dedicated skills\n\nLet me give a thoughtful, personal recommendation rather than just listing random skills.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话，你现在这套已经挺完整了——盯盘、交易、新闻、持仓、作息提醒，全是你自己写的 Python 脚本在跑，不依赖外部 skill。\n\n非要加的话，我觉得值得考虑两个：\n\n**1. GitHub skill** — 你的 Morgan 仓库一直没 push 上去，有这个之后你可以直接让我帮你提交、推送、打 tag，不用自己开终端。内置列表里就有，直接用。\n\n**2. Notion / 笔记类** — 如果你平时用 Notion 记笔记或做学习计划，我可以帮你读写。学生嘛，课程安排、作业 deadline 这种东西让我帮你管比较省心。\n\n其他像天气、健康检查这些其实内置已经有了，需要的时候会自动触发。\n\n说白了你不缺功能，缺的是把已有的工具串起来用好。你觉得呢？👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":386,"output":988,"cacheRead":51968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53342,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780013676540}}
