{"type":"message","id":"dd9948e5","parentId":"35f0ba2f","timestamp":"2026-05-29T03:53:33.831Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The positions have changed since earlier:\n\n- SOL: was +1.12, now -1.71 → dropped\n- XRP: was -2.48, now -2.22 → slightly improved\n- LINK: was +2.95, now +1.40 → significantly dropped\n- BTC: NEW! SHORT position opened at ~$73,580, currently at $73,270, +0.95 USDT\n\nSo BTC was opened as a SHORT and is currently profitable. The total floating P&L went from +1.58 to -1.57. Net P&L went from -2.09 to -5.25.\n\nNews is the same as earlier - no new updates.\n\nLet me present this clearly. The interesting thing is BTC was added as a short position.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开了个新仓，BTC 进来了！但大盘在回撤，之前的利润吐回去不少 👑\n\n- 👑 **BTC SHORT** +0.95 USDT (+0.43%) ✨ 新开空单\n- 🔗 **LINK** +1.40 USDT (+0.75%) — 剩这点\n- 🪙 **XRP** -2.22 USDT (-1.11%)\n- ⚡ **SOL** -1.71 USDT (-0.43%) — 从赚变亏\n\n浮动 -1.57，已实现 -3.68，**净亏 -5.25**。\n\nBTC 空单进得不错，其他三个多单被大盘拖下来了。4 仓打满，暂时没空间了。新闻面没什么大变化，还是那些 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":954,"output":511,"cacheRead":86784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88249,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780026804480}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0fb0bc0","parentId":"dd9948e5","timestamp":"2026-05-29T08:01:39.283Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ea030ec6cacb4b716e4bb3a42c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-29 16:01 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ea030ec6cacb4b716e4bb3a42c]\n用户124241: 交易了多少单了老婆，可以找到优化策略方向吗"}],"timestamp":1780041699255}}
{"type":"message","id":"67a83c0c","parentId":"e0fb0bc0","timestamp":"2026-05-29T08:01:54.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know how many trades have been executed and wants to find optimization directions for the strategy. Let me check:\n\n1. Total trade count from Binance userTrades\n2. Trade performance analysis\n3. Strategy audit\n\nLet me run multiple queries.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_IsylwXlJQSrFLnqRWAnK9444","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, ssl\nimport urllib.request\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta\n\nwith open('auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\napi_key = cfg['binance_api']['api_key']\nsecret = cfg['binance_api']['secret_key']\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\n\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\nctx.check_hostname = False\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\nproxy = urllib.request.ProxyHandler({'http': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890', 'https': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'})\nhttps_handler = urllib.request.HTTPSHandler(context=ctx)\nopener = urllib.request.build_opener(proxy, https_handler)\nurllib.request.install_opener(opener)\n\ndef signed_get(path):\n    ts = int(time.time() * 1000)\n    params = f'timestamp={ts}'\n    sig = hmac.new(secret.encode(), params.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    url = f'{base}{path}?{params}&signature={sig}'\n    r = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key})\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(r, timeout=15) as resp:\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\n\ntz = timezone(timedelta(hours=8))\ntrades = signed_get('/fapi/v1/userTrades')\nprint(f'总成交 {len(trades)} 笔')\n\n# Analyze by symbol and direction\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nby_symbol = defaultdict(lambda: {'buy': 0, 'sell': 0, 'total_pnl': 0, 'buy_pnl': 0, 'sell_pnl': 0})\nfor t in trades:\n    sym = t['symbol']\n    side = t.get('side', '?')\n    pnl = float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0))\n    by_symbol[sym]['total_pnl'] += pnl\n    if side == 'BUY':\n        by_symbol[sym]['buy'] += 1\n        by_symbol[sym]['buy_pnl'] += pnl\n    else:\n        by_symbol[sym]['sell'] += 1\n        by_symbol[sym]['sell_pnl'] += pnl\n\nprint('\\n按币种统计:')\nfor sym in sorted(by_symbol.keys()):\n    d = by_symbol[sym]\n    total = d['buy'] + d['sell']\n    print(f'  {sym}: {total}笔 (买{d[\\\"buy\\\"]}/卖{d[\\\"sell\\\"]}) 已实现盈亏={d[\\\"total_pnl\\\"]:+.2f}U')\n\n# Overall P&L\ntotal_pnl = sum(d['total_pnl'] for d in by_symbol.values())\nprint(f'\\n累计已实现盈亏: {total_pnl:+.2f} USDT')\n\n# Recent trade timeline\nprint('\\n最近10笔:')\nfor t in trades[-10:]:\n    dt = datetime.fromtimestamp(t['time']/1000, tz).strftime('%m-%d %H:%M')\n    print(f'  {dt} {t[\\\"symbol\\\"]} {t.get(\\\"side\\\",\\\"?\\\"):4s} qty={t.get(\\\"qty\\\"):>8s} @{t.get(\\\"price\\\"):>10s} PnL={float(t.get(\\\"realizedPnl\\\",0)):+.4f}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_BYeOEGMyzzStUNM3p7yu3772","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 audit_strategy.py 2>&1 | tail -50","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":311,"output":1041,"cacheRead":88064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89416,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780041699276}}
