{"type":"message","id":"5ee4b4f5","parentId":"48de9841","timestamp":"2026-05-29T08:02:13.619Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good data. Let me analyze:\n\n1. Total trades: 104, cumulative realized PnL: +96.14 USDT — this is GREAT! Almost doubled the account in testnet.\n\n2. By symbol:\n- BTC: +25.50 (best performer with 12 trades)\n- ETH: +30.95 (best with 9 trades)\n- DOT: +28.59 (22 trades)\n- XRP: +17.29 (9 trades)\n- BNB: +5.63 (9 trades)\n- ETC: -0.60 (3 trades, small)\n- LINK: -1.76 (currently has an open position)\n- SOL: -9.45 (29 trades! Most trades, only loser)\n\n3. Key insights:\n- SOL is the clear problem child — 29 trades but net loss of -9.45. Too many trades, low win rate.\n- BTC, ETH, DOT, XRP are the money makers\n- 46 \"max positions\" skips — need to consider a position management rule for rotating\n\n4. Strategy audit says:\n- Scoring: OK\n- Auto open: 46 fails (all because BTC max positions)\n- Trailing TP/SL: no update in 60 min\n\nLet me give the user a clear summary and optimization suggestions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"104 笔，累计已实现 **+96.14 USDT**，成绩不错 👑\n\n**各币种表现：**\n\n| 币种 | 交易次数 | 盈亏 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| ETH | 9 笔 | +30.95 ✅ |\n| DOT | 22 笔 | +28.59 ✅ |\n| BTC | 12 笔 | +25.50 ✅ |\n| XRP | 9 笔 | +17.29 ✅ |\n| BNB | 9 笔 | +5.63 ✅ |\n| ETC | 3 笔 | -0.60 ⚪ |\n| LINK | 11 笔 | -1.76 ⚪ |\n| **SOL** | **29 笔** | **-9.45** ❌ |\n\n**一眼看出的问题：**\n\n1. **SOL 是毒瘤** — 29 笔交易换 -9.45U，频率是其他币的 2-3 倍，胜率太低。原因：方向频繁反转 + 之前的仓位翻倍 bug 放大亏损\n2. **ETH / DOT / BTC / XRP 四天王** — 9-22 笔全盈利，主力赚钱品种\n3. **满仓堵门** — 审计报告显示 46 次开仓被挡在\"已达最大持仓\"，空有信号进不去\n\n**优化方向：**\n\n- **SOL 降权或限频**：信号冷却从 3 分钟拉到 10 分钟，或评分阈值提高 10 分\n- **仓位轮换机制**：持仓满 4 个时，若新信号评分高出最低持仓 20 分以上，自动平最差的换新的\n- **BTC 仓位精度**：刚才 BTC 开了 0.0028 BTC，拆成 6 笔碎单——数量精度太低，应该调成 3 位有效\n\n要不要我挑一个方向先动手？👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":850,"output":967,"cacheRead":89344,"cacheWrite":0