{"type":"message","id":"e65f2a54","parentId":"fa05b113","timestamp":"2026-05-29T08:04:25.072Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a task plan. Let me think about what we discussed and create a prioritized plan.\n\nFrom today's analysis:\n1. SOL reversal quantity bug - FIXED already\n2. SOL overtrading / high loss rate\n3. BTC precision leading to fragmented orders\n4. Position rotation/prioritization when at max (46 times blocked)\n5. Strategy optimization priorities\n\nLet me write this as a clean Markdown file in the workspace.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_GUwku5oXFozDGX1t7JDR7689","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-29.md","content":"# 2026-05-29 日志\n\n## 策略优化任务计划\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n- **仓位反转数量修复**：crypto_signal_monitor.py L2232，反转重建持仓时改为按风控规则重算数量，不再用 API 的 abs(amt)\n\n### 📋 待执行（优先级排序）\n\n#### P0 - SOL 限制\n- SOL 29笔/-9.45U，频率最高亏损最大\n- 方案：信号冷却从 3min → 10min，或评分阈值 +10\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 冷却逻辑 / 评分阈值\n\n#### P1 - BTC 下单精度\n- BTC 0.0028 拆成 6 笔碎单，未按 3 位精度合并\n- 方案：`format_quantity` 对 BTC 使用 3 位小数\n- 文件：`binance_auto_trade.py` format_quantity 函数\n\n#### P2 - 仓位轮换机制\n- 46 次开仓因满仓被挡，好信号进不来\n- 方案：持仓满 4 时，新信号评分高出最低持仓 20 分以上，自动平最差的换新的\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 开仓闸门\n\n#### P3 - 盈亏计算修正\n- 非标仓位盈亏按标准仓位算 → 数字虚高\n- 方案：盈亏按实际持仓数量 × 价格差计算\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 盈亏计算函数\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":295,"output":610,"cacheRead":90880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91785,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780041852743}}
