{"type":"message","id":"58d07f29","parentId":"f6d397d8","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:14:59.905Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_CH9qZZJgiIf5aOrU3bO69424","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \"circuit_breaker_pct\": -0.10,   # 日亏损超10%触发\n    \"circuit_breaker_hours\": 4,     # 暂停4小时\n\n    # 信号冷却\n    \"signal_cooldown\": {\n        \"same_direction\": 300,    # 同向5分钟\n        \"opposite\":       0,      # 反向立即\n    },\n\n    # 新闻过滤\n    \"news_blacklist\": [\n        \"hack\", \"exploit\", \"ban\", \"lawsuit\", \"regulation\",\n\n[2404 more lines in file. Use offset=107 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780046099899}}
{"type":"message","id":"1ff18fe4","parentId":"58d07f29","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:14:59.916Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_gZD45Pp3QvO3LNafCQyI4785","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 九、信号冷却\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nclass CooldownManager:\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._last: dict = {}   # key → timestamp\n        self._push_buffer: dict = {}  # symbol → {signals: [], last_time: 0}\n\n    def can_open(self, symbol: str, direction: str) -> bool:\n        now = time.time()\n        same_key = f\"{direction}_{symbol}\"\n        opp_dir  = \"SHORT\" if direction == \"LONG\" else \"LONG\"\n        opp_key  = f\"{opp_dir}_{symbol}\"\n\n        # 同向冷却\n        elapsed = now - self._last.get(same_key, 0)\n        if elapsed < CONFIG[\"signal_cooldown\"][\"same_direction\"]:\n            log.info(f\"⏳ {symbol} {direction} 冷却中，还需 {int(CONFIG['signal_cooldown']['same_direction']-elapsed)}秒\")\n            return False\n\n        self._last.pop(opp_key, None)\n        return True\n\n    def record(self, symbol: str, direction: str):\n        self._last[f\"{direction}_{symbol}\"] = time.time()\n\n    def reset_after_close(self, symbol: str):\n        \"\"\"平仓后清除该币种所有方向的冷却（让下次开仓不被卡）\"\"\"\n        self._last.pop(f\"LONG_{symbol}\", None)\n        self._last.pop(f\"SHORT_{symbol}\", None)\n\n[1663 more lines in file. Use offset=848 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780046099908}}
{"type":"message","id":"2872210f","parentId":"1ff18fe4","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:15:07.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the cooldown system. The `CONFIG[\"signal_cooldown\"][\"same_direction\"]` is 300 seconds (5 min) for all coins. There's no per-symbol cooldown. \n\nMy approach for P0 (SOL cooldown) could be:\n1. Add a per-symbol cooldown override to the config\n2. Modify the CooldownManager to check per-symbol cooldown\n\nOr simpler: add a SOL-specific cooldown of 600 seconds (10 min) in the config and modify `can_open` to use it.\n\nLet me do it cleanly:\n1. Add `per_symbol: {}` to signal_cooldown config\n2. Add SOL with 600s cooldown\n3. Modify `can_open` to check per-symbol override first\n\nAlso, the user mentioned \"评分阈值 +10\" — I should increase SOL's signal threshold too. Let me check where that happens.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_KUJg2wD44QlQIWErZnw83439","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n \"评分.*阈\\|阈值\\|threshold\\|评分.*min\\|min.*score\\|signal_threshold\\|开仓.*评分\" crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -15","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":622,"output":515,"cacheRead":101248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102385,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780046099927}}
