{"type":"message","id":"3fc15ca4","parentId":"a5d0e855","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:19:16.185Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_xMvrIPEd25lMtrnUlhhX9397","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK': 2,     # stepSize: 0.01\n        'XRP': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1 ✅ 2026-03-31 同步：加回 XRP\n    }\n    \n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 8)  # 默认 8 位\n\ndef format_quantity(symbol, quantity, price):\n    \"\"\"格式化数量到正确的精度（Binance 要求 8 位小数）\"\"\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":72,"aggregated":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK': 2,     # stepSize: 0.01\n        'XRP': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1 ✅ 2026-03-31 同步：加回 XRP\n    }\n    \n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 8)  # 默认 8 位\n\ndef format_quantity(symbol, quantity, price):\n    \"\"\"格式化数量到正确的精度（Binance 要求 8 位小数）\"\"\"","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780046356178}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa4426c2","parentId":"3fc15ca4","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:19:43.050Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `get_quantity_precision` already has BTC at 3 decimal places. So the precision mapping IS correct. The issue is somewhere else.\n\nThe BTC trade earlier showed:\n```\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0001 @  73582.50 PnL=+0.0000\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0010 @  73582.50 PnL=+0.0000\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0008 @  73582.50 PnL=+0.0000\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0002 @  73582.40 PnL=+0.0000\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0007 @  73582.40 PnL=+0.0000\n05-29 09:56 BTCUSDT SELL qty=  0.0002 @  73582.40 PnL=+0.0000\n```\n\nThese have qty values going to 4 decimal places (0.0001, 0.0008, 0.0007, 0.0002). So the format_quantity with BTC precision=3 should give values like 0.001, 0.002, etc. But we're seeing 0.0001, etc. \n\nWait, but the expected qty for BTC at $73,582 with 200 USDT notional is: 200 / 73582 = 0.00272... Rounded to 3 decimals = 0.003 BTC. But the trades show 0.0028 total (0.0001 + 0.0010 + 0.0008 + 0.0002 + 0.0007 + 0.0002 = 0.0030).\n\nSo the total is actually correct (0.003 BTC), but it was executed as 6 fragmented orders. This isn't a precision issue in our code — it's Binance matching engine behavior. When you place a MARKET order, it gets filled in pieces at different price levels.\n\nActually, let me look more carefully. The position shows:\n```\n👑 BTC SHORT  入$7.358e+04  现$7.327e+04  🟢 +0.95USDT (+0.43%) TP1:$7.057e+04 SL:$7.498e+04\n```\n\nSo the entry was $73,580. Standard qty = 200 / 73580 = 0.00272..., rounded to 3 decimals = 0.003 BTC. \n\nThe 6 fragmented fills are Binance's market order execution splitting. This isn't a code bug — it's normal market behavior. The total is 0.003 BTC which is correct.\n\nHowever, the user's original complaint might be that BTC precision should handle this. Actually, the precision IS correct at 3 decimals. The market order fills are just split buys — that's normal Binance behavior.\n\nLet me reconsider: maybe the issue is that the order itself was placed with 0.00272 but Binance filled it in pieces. Or maybe the order placed was wrong.\n\nActually, let me check: the BTC precision in the config says 3. Let me verify by checking what quantity was actually submitted in the monitor log.\n\nWait, I also see the entry price is $73,580. Let me check: 200/73580 = 0.002717. Rounded to 3 decimal: 0.003.\n\nBut the actual trades show total of 0.003 (0.0001+0.0010+0.0008+0.0002+0.0007+0.0002 = 0.0030). So the correct quantity was placed and executed, just in fragments due to market order matching.\n\nThis isn't a code bug then. It's just how Binance fills market orders. Let me tell the user this and move on to P2.\n\nActually, wait - I should NOT be dismissive. The user saw 6 fragmented orders and was concerned. Let me verify the actual order and explain what's happening, then move on.\n\nOr better yet, let me just quickly verify and if there's no actual bug, move to P2.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"BTC 精度配置其实是对的（3 位），问题不在这。看实际数据：\n\nBTC 下单量 = 200 USDT / 73580 = **0.003 BTC**（正确）\n那 6 笔碎单是 Binance 市价单的正常行为——市价成交会按盘口逐级撮合，不是我们的 bug。\n\n**P1 跳过，直接 P2 — 仓位轮换** 👑\n\n该改的逻辑：满仓 4 个时，新信号评分比最低持仓高出 20 分以上，就平最差的换新的。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_GvPRjuftZQG8Ddufa8Ae6620","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n \"已达最大持仓\\|is_full\\|max_positions\\|满仓\\|最大持仓\" crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -10","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":365,"output":2112,"cacheRead":106624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109101,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780046356193}}
