{"type":"compaction","id":"a4654d72","parentId":"a3667d9a","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:22:43.458Z","summary":"## Goal\nThe user (yuki/老公, identified as \"用户124241\" in Feishu group chat) is managing their crypto trading bot on OpenClaw. Key goals in this session: review market positions/P&L, check crypto news, learn about OpenClaw skills, diagnose position sizing anomalies (DOT 14U too small, SOL 400U too large), and fix the position reversal quantity bug.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Group chat context — sender is \"用户124241\" (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166), treated as yuki/老公\n- Binance Testnet only, 100 USDT total capital, 20% position size, 10x leverage\n- Each position should be ~200 USDT notional (= 20 USDT margin at 10x)\n- Edits must be to production code (`crypto_signal_monitor.py`), not copilot copies\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Reviewed market positions multiple times (query_positions.py)\n- [x] Traced -3.93 realized P&L to SOL BUY at 00:45:43 May 29 closing a SHORT\n- [x] Fetched crypto news via query_news.py (5 articles)\n- [x] Researched Anthropic Opus 4.8 release\n- [x] Explained OpenClaw skills system\n- [x] Identified GitHub skill and Notion skill are already built-in\n- [x] Confirmed git repo not pushed (needs GitHub credentials)\n- [x] Diagnosed DOT 14U anomaly: leftover from partial closes/reversals; DOT already closed at TP1 ~09:02\n- [x] Diagnosed SOL 400U anomaly: position reversal bug at line 2232\n- [x] **Fixed position reversal bug**: Replaced `'amount': abs(amt)` with proper `format_quantity(symbol, (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry, entry)` at line ~2232\n- [x] Confirmed `format_quantity` already imported (line 40)\n- [x] Used `10` instead of `LEVERAGE` variable (only defined in function scope at line 1187)\n- [x] Restarted monitor via `kj`\n- [x] Confirmed syntax clean (`python3 -c \"import py_compile; py_compile.compile(...)\"`)\n- [x] Acknowledged DOT P&L miscalculation: monitor log showed +4.01 USDT but actual was $0.28 (11.7 DOT × $0.024), because P&L formula uses standard position size ($200 notional) instead of actual position size ($14 notional)\n\n### In Progress\n- (none)\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Position sizing bug root cause**: In `crypto_signal_monitor.py` line 2232, position reversal rebuild used `abs(amt)` from API instead of risk-rule-based quantity\n- **Fix applied**: `correct_amount = format_quantity(symbol, (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry, entry)` — logs `🔧 反转重建 XXX：API原始=X → 风控标准=Y`\n- **Used `10` not `LEVERAGE`**: `LEVERAGE = 10` only exists in function scope (line 1187), not module-level\n- **P&L display bug identified (monitor log)**: P&L calculation at ~line 1188 uses `CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"] * LEVERAGE * pnl_pct * size_ratio` — this assumes standard position size, not actual quantity. Same root cause as reversal bug, now partially mitigated since future positions will be correctly sized\n- **DOT actual P&L**: 11.7 × ($1.222 - $1.198) = $0.28 (not $4.01 from log)\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Current SOL oversized position (4.87) will self-correct on next reversal/close — no manual action needed unless user requests\n2. Git push still pending (needs GitHub token)\n3. Monitor P&L display formula could be improved to use actual position size, but low priority since corrected positions will align with standard size\n\n## Critical Context\n- **File edited**: `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` line ~2232\n- **Config**: total_capital=100, position_size_pct=0.20, leverage=10, max_positions=4\n- **Formula**: `raw_qty = (100 * 0.20 * 10) / entry_price` → expected ~200 USDT notional per position\n- **Current positions** (as of ~09:13 May 29): SOL LONG 4.87@81.91, XRP LONG 150.8@1.327, LINK LONG 21.23@8.876\n- **Git repo**: `https://github.com/yuki39lhl-huang/Morgan.git` (private), uncommitted changes exist\n- **User IDs**: sender ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166, group oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\n- **Trade data**: SOL BUY 4.87 @ 81.88 with -3.93 realized (00:45:43 May 29); DOT closed TP1 @ 1.222 (09:02, actual P&L $0.28)\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Decisions\n- 当前尚无新的技术决策，需先查证昨日是否已配置Flash模型。\n\n## Open TODOs\n1. 查找Flash模型的相关配置文件（可能位于 /root/.openclaw/ 下其他位置）或昨日操作日志。\n2. 确认Flash模型的准确名称和接入方式（预计同为 deepseek provider）。\n3. 修改代码/配置，使日常聊天路由到Flash模型，代码/信号处理保持使用Pro模型。\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- 日常聊天使用 Flash 模型，代码/信号处理使用 Pro 模型（昨日口头约定）。\n- API 提供商：deepseek，API key: `sk-e91eabcb8c7d4a15a867fac0a3fb1c07`，base_url: `https://api.deepseek.com`。\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户质疑：「昨天不是添加了flash模型吗，咱还说好了修改代码调用pro日常聊天flash」——即要求当前系统必须按约定使用Flash进行日常聊天，而非仅使用Pro。\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- 用户ID：`ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`\n- 消息ID：`om_x100b6ebae05de8a8b3cbc929395c47c`\n- 群聊标识：`oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n- 时间戳：`Fri 2026-05-29 09:24 GMT+8`\n- 当前生效配置文件：`/root/.openclaw/config.yaml`（仅含 `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro` 作为 default）\n- 尝试读取的日志文件：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-28.md`（不存在，退出码1）\n- API key：`sk-e91eabcb8c7d4a15a867fac0a3fb1c07`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6ebad5d9bcb0b2ca5744b4ea9fe\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-29 09:19 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6ebad5d9bcb0b2ca5744b4ea...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (exec): 2026-05-29 09:19:25 [INFO] 📌 LINK 止损 Algo 单已提交：8.6985 algoId=1000000089162834\n2026-0