{"type":"message","id":"4a739035","parentId":"f58b548a","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:25:10.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, both `save_positions` and `close_position` exist. Let me check the close_position signature and return type to make sure my call is compatible.\n\nMy call:\n```python\nclose_result = close_position(\n    weakest[\"symbol\"], weakest[\"type\"],\n    reason=f\"轮换替换（{sym}信号{new_score}分 > {weakest['symbol']}{weakest_score}分+20）\"\n)\n```\n\nBut the function signature is:\n```python\ndef close_position(pos: dict, reason: str, size_ratio: float, current_price: float):\n```\n\nSo my call is WRONG! I'm passing:\n- weakest[\"symbol\"] (a string) instead of pos (a dict)\n- weakest[\"type\"] (a string) instead of reason\n- A reason string instead of size_ratio\n\nThis will cause a runtime error! I need to fix this.\n\nLet me check what close_position returns and how it's called elsewhere.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_AcfdQnAhqkHNsOyJDHKh4480","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1160,"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":169,"output":492,"cacheRead":54912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55573,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780046704183}}
{"type":"message","id":"ac2b52e3","parentId":"4a739035","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:25:10.203Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_AcfdQnAhqkHNsOyJDHKh4480","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def close_position(pos: dict, reason: str, size_ratio: float, current_price: float):\n    entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n    typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n    symbol = pos[\"symbol\"]\n    qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\n    \n    qty = format_quantity(symbol, qty_raw, entry)\n\n    # 实盘平仓调用（使用 place_order with reduce_only=True）\n    # 平仓重试机制（最多 3 次）\n    close_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):  # 2026-03-31 优化：3->5 次\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                # 🐛 Bug 修复：传递 current_price 用于日志显示正确价格\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,  # 2026-03-27 老公指示：3x→10x 测试两天\n                    reduce_only=True,\n                    price=current_price,  # 传递当前价格用于日志\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                # 成功就跳出重试\n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                else:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 2 else '放弃'}\")\n                    if attempt < 4:\n                        time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"❌ 平仓异常第{attempt+1}次：{e}\")\n                close_result = {\"error\": str(e), \"success\": False}\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n\n    # 计算盈亏 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：添加杠杆倍数\n    pnl_pct = (current_price - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - current_price) / entry\n    LEVERAGE = 10\n    pnl_usdt = CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"] * LEVERAGE * pnl_pct * size_ratio\n    # 2026-03-25 老公指示：用实际成交价计算真实盈亏\n    if close_result and close_result.get('success') and close_result.get('order'):\n        realized = close_result.get('order', {}).get('realizedPnl')\n        if realized is not None:\n            pnl_usdt = float(realized)\n\n\n    # 检查平仓是否真正成功\n\n[1366 more lines in file. Use offset=1210 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780046710187}}
{"type":"message","id":"33774082","parentId":"ac2b52e3","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:25:18.993Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue clearly. `close_position` takes:\n1. `pos` — a dict (the full position dict)\n2. `reason` — a string\n3. `size_ratio` — a float (how much to close, 0-1)\n4. `current_price` — the current price\n\nMy rotation code calls:\n```python\nclose_result = close_position(\n    weakest[\"symbol\"], weakest[\"type\"],\n    reason=f\"轮换替换（...\"\n)\n```\n\nThis is completely wrong! It should be:\n```python\nclose_result = close_position(\n    weakest,  # dict\n    f\"轮换替换（{sym}信号{new_score}分 > {weakest['symbol']}{weakest_score}分+20）\",  # reason\n    1.0,  # size_ratio (close all)\n    prices.get(weakest[\"symbol\"], {}).get(\"price\", 0)  # current_price\n)\n```\n\nAlso, the return check: `close_result.get(\"success\")` — but from the code I can see `close_result` is from `place_order` which returns a dict. Let me check what other callers do with the return.\n\nLet me also check how `close_position` is called elsewhere to confirm the pattern.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_uShcDciLKSpwR6E4eq7C4143","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n \"close_position(\" crypto_signal_monitor.py | grep -v \"def close_position\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":707,"output":632,"cacheRead":55296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56635,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780046710215}}
