{"type":"message","id":"70137655","parentId":"6a6d6778","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:38:38.701Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_fjRZvV1U0urx1fjtK1T13800","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026-05-29 17:38:36 [INFO] 🔄 已加载 auto_trade_config.json（API key 前缀：4XOtZh5r...10XU）\n/root/.local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/urllib3/connectionpool.py:1097: InsecureRequestWarning: Unverified HTTPS request is being made to host '127.0.0.1'. Adding certificate verification is strongly advised. See: https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advanced-usage.html#tls-warnings\n  warnings.warn(\n2026-05-29 17:38:38 [INFO] ✅ 从 Binance API 获取 4 个持仓\n[OK] 当前持仓 4 个 (Binance Testnet 实时)\n  ⚡ SOL LONG   入$81.91      现$82.4       🟢 +2.38USDT (+0.60%) TP1:$85.19 SL:$80.27\n  🪙 XRP LONG   入$1.327      现$1.326      🔴 -0.07USDT (-0.04%) TP1:$1.38 SL:$1.3\n  🔗 LINK LONG   入$8.876      现$9.037      🟢 +3.41USDT (+1.81%) TP1:$9.231 SL:$8.698\n  👑 BTC SHORT  入$7.358e+04  现$7.381e+04  🔴 -0.68USDT (-0.31%) TP1:$7.057e+04 SL:$7.498e+04\n\n  浮动盈亏: +5.04 USDT\n  今日已实现: -3.68 USDT\n  🎉 净盈亏: +1.36 USDT"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6470,"aggregated":"2026-05-29 17:38:36 [INFO] 🔄 已加载 auto_trade_config.json（API key 前缀：4XOtZh5r...10XU）\n/root/.local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/urllib3/connectionpool.py:1097: InsecureRequestWarning: Unverified HTTPS request is being made to host '127.0.0.1'. Adding certificate verification is strongly advised. See: https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advanced-usage.html#tls-warnings\n  warnings.warn(\n2026-05-29 17:38:38 [INFO] ✅ 从 Binance API 获取 4 个持仓\n[OK] 当前持仓 4 个 (Binance Testnet 实时)\n  ⚡ SOL LONG   入$81.91      现$82.4       🟢 +2.38USDT (+0.60%) TP1:$85.19 SL:$80.27\n  🪙 XRP LONG   入$1.327      现$1.326      🔴 -0.07USDT (-0.04%) TP1:$1.38 SL:$1.3\n  🔗 LINK LONG   入$8.876      现$9.037      🟢 +3.41USDT (+1.81%) TP1:$9.231 SL:$8.698\n  👑 BTC SHORT  入$7.358e+04  现$7.381e+04  🔴 -0.68USDT (-0.31%) TP1:$7.057e