{"type":"message","id":"9efb312e","parentId":"4ec27955","timestamp":"2026-05-29T10:04:01.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The errors are all SSL errors from Binance API — intermittent network issues. The errors are spread across the day (13:02, 13:02, 13:03, ... 17:35, 17:44). These are:\n\n1. SSL EOF errors and timeouts — intermittent proxy/network issues with testnet.binancefuture.com. This is normal.\n2. One warning about margin type: \"No need to change margin type\" — already isolated, harmless.\n3. The 13:00-13:08 period had a cluster of errors — probably a brief proxy outage.\n\nNo code bugs or tracebacks in the log. These are all network-level issues, not code bugs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"都是网络抖动，没有代码 bug 👑\n\n全是 `SSL EOF` / `Read timed out` — Binance 测试网偶尔断连，代理波动导致的，重试之后自己恢复了。那个 BNB 的 `No need to change margin type` 也正常，早就设好了逐仓模式。\n\n代码层面干净，P0 + P2 没报错 👍"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2114,"output":369,"cacheRead":67840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70323,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780049033414}}
