{"type":"message","id":"adf85e95","parentId":"a9668147","timestamp":"2026-05-29T10:05:29.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All three tasks are done. Let me summarize for the user:\n\nP0 ✅ SOL 限频 (冷却10min + 门槛+10) \nP1 ⏭️ BTC 精度 (非 bug)\nP2 ✅ 仓位轮换 (满仓时新信号比最弱+20分可换)\nP3 ✅ 盈亏计算修正 (用实际数量代替标准仓位)\n\nAll need a restart to take effect.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"语法通过 ✅\n\n**P3 完成 — 盈亏计算修正：**\n\n改了一处关键行：`close_position` 里的盈亏从 `总资金 × 仓位比例 × 杠杆 × 涨跌幅` 改成 `实际数量 × 入场价 × 涨跌幅`。\n\n之前 DOT 11.7 个平仓算成 +4.01，实际才 +0.28，就是因为这个。现在用的就是真实数量了。\n\n---\n\n**三件套全搞定：**\n\n| 任务 | 状态 | 改动 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| P0 SOL 限频 | ✅ | 冷却 10min + 门槛 +10 分 |\n| P1 BTC 精度 | ⏭️ | 非 bug，Binance 正常撮合 |\n| P2 仓位轮换 | ✅ | 满仓 +20 分可踢弱换强 |\n| P3 盈亏修正 | ✅ | 用实际数量，不再虚高 |\n\n重启生效，你来 `kj` 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":24,"output":398,"cacheRead":73856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74278,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780049122309}}
