{"type":"message","id":"830d4187","parentId":"119cc503","timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:43:34.544Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see! The rotation mechanism triggered! \n\n- At 19:34:31: `🔄 仓位轮换：LINK SHORT(65分) 替换 SOL(10分)`\n- SOL was closed, and the P&L was +0.48 USDT (0.12% profit)\n- The log says: `✅ 平仓 SOL 轮换替换（LINK信号65分 > SOL10分+20） | 入场:81.9107 出场:82.0100 | PnL:0.12% (+0.48USDT)`\n\nSo the rotation worked! SOL (only 10 points) was swapped for LINK SHORT (65 points). This is actually the P2 rotation feature working as designed.\n\nBut the user says \"止损怎么这么奇怪\" and \"SOL的+0.4U就打掉了\" — they think it was stopped out by a stop-loss, but it was actually the ROTATION mechanism that closed it.\n\nThe user might not understand that this was the new rotation feature, not a stop-loss trigger. Let me explain this clearly.\n\nAlso, the P3 fix is working: PnL:0.12% (+0.48USDT) — previously it would have shown a much larger number. Let me verify: qty=4.87, entry=81.91, exit=82.01, P&L = 4.87 * (82.01-81.91) = 4.87 * 0.10 = 0.487 ≈ 0.48 ✅ P3 fix is working!\n\nAnd the rotation is working: SOL with 10 points was swapped for LINK SHORT with 65 points (10 + 20 = 30 ≤ 65 ✅).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不是止损打的，是 **P2 轮换机制** 触发了 👑\n\n日志写得清清楚楚：\n\n```\n🔄 仓位轮换：LINK SHORT(65分) 替换 SOL(10分)\n```\n\nSOL 只有 10 分，LINK 信号 65 分，高出 55 分远超 20 分门槛，自动平 SOL 换 LINK SHORT。+0.48U 小赚离场。\n\n同时也验证了 P3 盈亏修正准确：4.87 × (82.01 - 81.91) = 0.48U ✅\n\n你现在看到的就是：原 LINK LONG 被平掉了，同时 SOL 也清掉了，新开了 LINK SHORT。实际还剩几个仓位？我看看 👇"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1659,"output":902,"cacheRead":80128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82689,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780055001507}}
