{"type":"message","id":"2ff2100b","parentId":"7613b15d","timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:47:06.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also check other things:\n\n1. Do we also need to handle the LINK LONG + LINK SHORT conflict more explicitly in rotation?\n   - After rotation closes weakest (SOL), the code falls through to open `sym` (LINK). But LINK already has a position (LINK LONG). The duplicate check should catch this.\n   - Let me verify the duplicate check is still in the right place.\n\n2. Is there any issue with `positions` being out of sync after rotation?\n   - After rotation: `positions = [p for p in positions if p[\"symbol\"] != weakest[\"symbol\"]]` — removes weakest from positions\n   - Then `save_positions(positions)` saves to file\n   - Then falls through to open code\n   - Open code might call `get_all_positions()` to verify\n\nLet me verify the duplication check:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_KE9iJx97BXQuybnYAnDK9882","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":2438,"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":45,"output":450,"cacheRead":89728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90223,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780055220559}}
{"type":"message","id":"5395fa1e","parentId":"2ff2100b","timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:47:07.028Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_KE9iJx97BXQuybnYAnDK9882","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                        if not cooldown_manager.can_open(sym, direction):\n                            continue\n\n                        # 同一币种不能重复开仓 - 2026-04-27 老公指示：API 真相优先\n                        # 本地 positions 缓存可能滞后（多进程/race condition），必须从 Binance API 实时查\n                        try:\n                            api_positions_check = get_all_positions() or []\n                        except Exception as _e:\n                            log.warning(f\"⚠️ 检查持仓时 API 异常：{_e}，回退本地缓存\")\n                            api_positions_check = positions\n                        api_has_symbol = any(\n                            p.get(\"symbol\") == sym and float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0\n                            for p in api_positions_check\n                        )\n                        local_has_symbol = any(p[\"symbol\"] == sym for p in positions)\n                        if api_has_symbol or local_has_symbol:\n                            log.info(f\"⚠️ {sym} 已有持仓（api={api_has_symbol}, local={local_has_symbol}），跳过重复开仓\")\n                            continue\n\n                        # 2026-03-28 老公指示：移除同方向限制，只保留总持仓数限制\n                        # 原因：同方向 0-1U 浮动的仓位占位置，导致其他信号进不来\n\n                        # ═══════════════════════════════════════\n                        # AI 触发条件判断（2026-03-28 老公指示）\n                        # ═══════════════════════════════════════\n                        # 满仓时只保留新闻和浮亏判断，不做开仓确认\n                        is_full = len(positions) >= CONFIG[\"max_positions\"]\n                        \n                        should_trigger_ai = False\n                        \n\n[117 more lines in file. Use offset=2468 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780055227009}}
{"type":"message","id":"7ea452e1","parentId":"5395fa1e","timestamp":"2026-05-29T11:47:22.152Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the duplicate check is in place at lines 2442-2456:\n1. API check: `api_positions_check = get_all_positions()`\n2. `api_has_symbol` — checks if `sym` is in API positions\n3. `local_has_symbol` — checks if `sym` is in local `positions`\n4. If either is true → skip opening\n\nAfter rotation closes SOL and falls through to open LINK SHORT:\n- `sym = \"LINK\"`\n- `api_positions_check` = API query for all positions → returns BNB, LINK, BTC\n- `api_has_symbol` for LINK = True → `continue` — SKIPS opening LINK SHORT!\n\nThis is correct behavior. The duplicate check prevents opening LINK SHORT when LINK LONG already exists. The rotation mechanism will close SOL but NOT open LINK SHORT. This is actually the correct outcome.\n\nBut this means we have a wasted close (SOL was closed but no new position opened). This should be rare since the rotation already checked `weakest.get(\"symbol\") == sym` — but that checks if the weakest IS the same symbol, not if the NEW signal's symbol already has a position.\n\nActually, I see the issue: the rotation code should also check if `sym` already has a position in the current portfolio. If it does, don't rotate! Let me add that check.\n\nWait, actually, looking at my code again:\n```python\nif weakest.get(\"symbol\") == sym:\n    log.info(f\"⚠️ {sym} 已有持仓，跳过自替换\")\n    continue\n```\n\nThis checks if the WEAKEST (the one being closed) is the same as sym (the new signal). But what about the case where sym already has a position that ISN'T the weakest? Like in this case: LINK is already in positions, but LINK is NOT the weakest (SOL is). So `weakest.get(\"symbol\") != sym` passes, and rotation proceeds, closes SOL, then falls through to open LINK but gets blocked by duplicate check.\n\nI should add a check: if `sym` already exists in ANY position, skip rotation.\n\nLet me add this check before the weakest search.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"还有一个问题——轮换时如果新信号的币种本身就在持仓里（比如 LINK 已有 LONG，又要开 LINK SHORT），白白平了 SOL 但开不了 LINK。加个检查："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_YYlsHnQWdOL8YKBWLzaB3413","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","new_string":"                            if not cooldown_manager.can_open(sym, new_dir):\n                                continue\n                            # 新信号币种已在持仓中，轮换无效\n                            sym_in_positions = any(p.get(\"symbol\") == sym and not p.get(\"is_closed\") for p in positions)\n                            if sym_in_positions:\n                                log.info(f\"⚠️ {sym} 已有持仓，跳过轮换\")\n                                continue\n                            # 找最低评分的持仓","old_string":"                            if not cooldown_manager.can_open(sym, new_dir):\n                                continue\n                            # 找最低评分的持仓"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":469,"output":1173,"cacheRead":89984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91626,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780055227046}}
