{"type":"message","id":"502f4e64","parentId":"536a06fd","timestamp":"2026-05-29T13:19:25.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so after all the trading:\n- SOL SHORT @ 81.40 (entry price changed from 81.83, was opened/closed)\n- DOT SHORT @ 1.188 (was opened via rotation, -0.51 now)\n- LINK LONG @ 8.876 (survived)\n- BTC SHORT @ 73160 (entry changed from 73580)\n\nThe rotation was too aggressive. With the min-hold fix:\n- New positions will be protected for 10 minutes\n- The 3-time DOT swap in 9 minutes won't happen anymore\n\nThe fix is good. Let me tell the user to restart.\n\nAlso, the realized PnL improved: from -3.80 to -2.59. But DOT is bleeding.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"被折腾了三次，手续费和滑点吃掉了约 1.2U。现在 DOT 换进来了，4 仓停在：\n\n- SOL SHORT / DOT SHORT / LINK LONG / BTC SHORT\n\n**修复内容**：新仓 10 分钟内不能参与轮换，DOT 9 分钟三次换手不会再出现。\n\n重启生效 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":422,"output":396,"cacheRead":96768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97586,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780060756993}}
