le from a3d6f53\n3. Re-apply only P0 (SOL cooldown + threshold) and P3 (PnL fix)\n\nBut the position reversal fix is already in the current code. Hmm.\n\nActually, the position reversal fix was done BEFORE the git push. So it's in eabbb4f which was pushed. And a3d6f53 is before that.\n\nLet me check: what's in a3d6f53 vs eabbb4f?\n\nActually, the simplest thing is:\n1. Look at what's in a3d6f53 for this file\n2. Check if the position reversal fix is in a3d6f53 or eabbb4f\n\nThe position reversal fix was done earlier today before the push. So it should be in eabbb4f.\n\nIf I checkout from a3d6f53, I lose the reversal fix too.\n\nBetter approach: just strip out P2 (rotation) from the current file. Remove:\n1. The rotation code block (lines ~2358-2430)\n2. Replace with the original simple break logic\n\nLet me do this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"只撤轮换，P0 和 P3 保留。直接从 git 对比一下改了什么："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fpclxUE9KQx8n9mqPxGH0531","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw && git diff a3d6f53 -- workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | grep \"^@@\\|^+\\|^-\" | head -80","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":314,"output":1555,"cacheRead":97408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99277,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780061788470}}
{"type":"message","id":"1efe32ef","parentId":"42a5fc24","timestamp":"2026-05-29T13:36:47.284Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_fpclxUE9KQx8n9mqPxGH0531","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--- a/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py\n+++ b/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py\n@@ -70,6 +70,10 @@ CONFIG = {\n+        # 单币阈值加成：等于提高开仓门槛\n+        \"per_symbol_bonus\": {\n+            \"SOL\": 10,           # SOL 历史胜率低，多要10分\n+        },\n@@ -99,6 +103,10 @@ CONFIG = {\n+        # 单币冷却覆盖（秒），SOL 高频低胜率，拉长冷却\n+        \"per_symbol\": {\n+            \"SOL\": 600,           # 10分钟\n+        },\n@@ -551,6 +559,8 @@ def calc_score(\n+    # 单币阈值加成：低胜率币种提高门槛\n+    threshold += CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"].get(\"per_symbol_bonus\", {}).get(symbol, 0)\n@@ -829,10 +839,13 @@ class CooldownManager:\n-        # 同向冷却\n+        # 同向冷却（优先用单币覆盖，否则默认）\n+        cooldown_sec = CONFIG[\"signal_cooldown\"].get(\"per_symbol\", {}).get(\n+            symbol, CONFIG[\"signal_cooldown\"][\"same_direction\"]\n+        )\n-        if elapsed < CONFIG[\"signal_cooldown\"][\"same_direction\"]:\n-            log.info(f\"⏳ {symbol} {direction} 冷却中，还需 {int(CONFIG['signal_cooldown']['same_direction']-elapsed)}秒\")\n+        if elapsed < cooldown_sec:\n+            log.info(f\"⏳ {symbol} {direction} 冷却中，还需 {int(cooldown_sec - elapsed)}秒 (冷却={cooldown_sec}s)\")\n@@ -1182,11 +1195,11 @@ def close_position(pos: dict, reason: str, size_ratio: float, current_price: flo\n-    # 计算盈亏 - 2026-03-30 老公指示：添加杠杆倍数\n+    # 计算盈亏 - 使用实际持仓数量，不再用标准仓位\n-    LEVERAGE = 10\n-    pnl_usdt = CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"] * LEVERAGE * pnl_pct * size_ratio\n-    # 2026-03-25 老公指示：用实际成交价计算真实盈亏\n+    qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\n+    pnl_usdt = qty_raw * entry * pnl_pct  # 实际数量 × 入场价 × 涨跌幅\n+    # 2026-03-25 老公指示：用实际成交价计算真实盈亏（API 返回的 realizedPnl 优先）\n@@ -2218,6 +2231,11 @@ async def main():\n+                            # 🐛 修复：反转重建持仓时按风控规则重算