{"type":"message","id":"ee4f4ba7","parentId":"a687edbe","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:03:05.660Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No actual close/平仓 events logged. The positions just went from 4 to 3 during restart — the monitor restarted and only found 3 positions on the exchange. \n\nBefore the restart (at 21:36), we had those rotation events that swapped positions. After the chaos (21:03-21:12), the positions were: SOL SHORT, DOT SHORT, LINK LONG, BTC SHORT (4 positions).\n\nThen at 21:19 they were: SOL SHORT, DOT SHORT, LINK LONG, BTC SHORT (4 positions).\n\nNow at 21:50 restart: DOT SHORT, XRP SHORT, BTC SHORT (3 positions). So SOL SHORT and LINK LONG were closed between 21:19 and 21:50.\n\nLet me check if there were any price movements or TP/SL hits during that time. Let me search more broadly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_OBviobeNe2WyGQ616sPS2384","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -E \"平仓|关闭|ALGO.*FILLED|止盈.*触发|止损.*触发\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log | grep \"21:1[9-9]\\|21:2[0-5]\\|21:3\\|21:4\" | head -10","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":536,"output":502,"cacheRead":106496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107534,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780063377776}}
