{"type":"message","id":"8c3b8148","parentId":"c90fa962","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:03:33.553Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see it now! At 21:28, the monitor was still running with the rotation code:\n\n```\n21:28 LINKUSDT SELL qty=   11.26 @     8.873 PnL=-0.0338\n21:28 LINKUSDT SELL qty=    9.97 @     8.867 PnL=-0.0897\n21:28 SOLUSDT BUY  qty=    2.46 @   81.3300 PnL=+0.1722\n21:28 XRPUSDT SELL qty=    76.5 @    1.3027 PnL=+0.0000\n21:28 XRPUSDT SELL qty=    15.3 @    1.3027 PnL=+0.0000\n21:28 XRPUSDT SELL qty=    61.8 @    1.3026 PnL=+0.0000\n```\n\nSo the rotation code (before we removed it) was still running and did another trade:\n- LINK LONG was closed (21.26 qty total, same as position had: 21.23 + some)\n- SOL was reopened (2.46 qty)\n- XRP was closed (153.6 total)\n\nThese were all from the rotation mechanism before the code was reverted. That's why positions went from 4 to 3 during restart — the rotation had been closing/opening positions and the old monitor stopped mid-rotation.\n\nThe key finding: the rotation code caused the LINK LONG close (21:28) and SOL re-open (21:28), and also partially closed XRP. Then the monitor was killed for restart, and on restart only 3 positions remained.\n\nThis explains the discrepancy. The rotation was still wreaking havoc before we killed it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"21:28 的时候旧代码还在换 — LINK LONG 被平了，SOL 和 XRP 也动了，全是轮换干的：\n\n```\n21:28 LINKUSDT SELL 21.26个 (-0.12U)  ← 被踢\n21:28 SOLUSDT BUY  2.46个            ← 重新开\n21:28 XRPUSDT SELL 153.6个           ← 被踢\n```\n\n然后你重启了，之前的历史被清理，剩 DOT / XRP / BTC 三个空单。现在轮换已撤掉，不会再疯了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":4453,"output":905,"cacheRead":107904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780063400471}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"6b51931d","parentId":"8c3b8148","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:04:40.782Z","summary":"## Goals\n1. Optimize trading strategy: fix SOL over-trading (P0), verify BTC precision (P1), add position rotation (P2), fix P&L calculation (P3)\n2. Update memory file with strategy plan and execution progress\n3. Push code to GitHub\n4. Verify rotation code correctness before restart\n5. Close XRP position manually\n6. Restart monitor and verify logs are clean\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Group chat context — sender is \"用户124241\" (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166), treated as yuki/老公\n- Binance Testnet only, 100 USDT total capital, 20% position size, 10x leverage\n- Each position should be ~200 USDT notional (= 20 USDT margin at 10x)\n- Edits must be to production code (`crypto_signal_monitor.py`), not copilot copies\n- Memory flushes: appending only to `memory/2026-05-29.md`, never overwriting MEMORY.md/SOUL.md/TOOLS.md/AGENTS.md\n- GitHub push via proxy `127.0.0.1:7890`\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Created strategy optimization plan (P0-P3) in `memory/2026-05-29.md`\n- [x] **P0 — SOL 限频**: Added `signal_cooldown.per_symbol.SOL = 600` (10min) and `score_threshold.per_symbol_bonus.SOL = 10` in config; modified `CooldownManager.can_open` and `calc_score` to support per-symbol overrides\n- [x] **P1 — BTC 下单精度**: Determined not a bug — BTC precision config is already correct (3 decimals);碎单 is normal Binance market order matching behavior\n- [x] **P2 — 仓位轮换**: When positions are full (4), if new signal score ≥ weakest position + 20, auto-close weakest and open new signal; code edited in `crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- [x] **Rotation code bug fixes** (user requested careful review):\n  - **Bug 1**: `close_position()` call signature was wrong — passed `(string, string, string)` instead of `(dict, str, float, float)`. Fixed to: `close_position(weakest, reason, 1.0, prices.get(weakest[\"symbol\"], {}).get(\"price\", 0))`\n  - **Bug 2**: `opened_this_loop += 1` and `actual_count -= 1` in rotation code caused double-counting. Fixed: removed both, let normal open logic handle counting\n  - **Edge case 1**: Added `weakest is None` guard → skip rotation if no valid positions\n  - **Edge case 2**: Added `weakest[\"symbol\"] == sym` guard → skip self-replacement\n- [x] **P3 — 盈亏计算修正**: Changed `close_position` line 1201 from `CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"] * LEVERAGE * pnl_pct * size_ratio` to `qty_raw * entry * pnl_pct` (actual quantity × entry price × P&L%). `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio` was already computed above.\n- [x] GitHub push: Commit `eabbb4f` pushed successfully; git proxy configured (`http.proxy`/`https.proxy` = `127.0.0.1:7890`)\n- [x] Closed XRP LONG manually (150.8 @ 1.3266 → `orderId=1670626752`, sold at market)\n- [x] Monitor restarted by user (`kj`) — confirmed running with 4 positions (SOL, BNB, LINK, BTC SHORT)\n- [x] Log review: only network-level errors (SSL EOF, timeout from Binance testnet), no code bugs\n- [x] All syntax checks passed for every edit\n\n### In Progress\n- ⏳ P0+P2+P3 need restart to take effect (user has restarted once for P0+P2; P3 still needs restart)\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **P3 P&L formula**: `qty_raw * entry * pnl_pct` where `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio`. Previous formula `CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"] * LEVERAGE * pnl_pct * size_ratio` assumed standard 200 USDT notional per position, causing DOT to show +4.01 USDT when actual was +0.28 USDT.\n- **Rotation doesn't count as \"open\"**: Removed `opened_this_loop += 1` from rotation close code — only actual new positions count\n- **Self-replacement prevention**: Rotation skips if `weakest[\"symbol\"] == sym` to avoid closing and immediately reopening the same symbol\n- **Token exposure**: `ghp_cpcfGLHV06Iei6rWTrf1Y8c4iu3C6u9H4r6eX` exposed in exec commands, needs revocation\n- **Hourly report P&L is already correct**: Uses API `unrealizedPnl` directly or `(current_price - entry) * amount` — only `close_position` was broken\n\n## Next Steps\n1. User needs to `kj` restart to apply P3 (P&L fix) — P0+P2 already restarted once\n2. Revoke exposed GitHub token `ghp_cpcfGLHV06Iei6rWTrf1Y8c4iu3C6u9H4r6eX`\n3. Observe rotation logic in action when next signal triggers while 4 positions are full\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Memory file**: `/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-29.md` (appended, not overwritten)\n- **Main script**: `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- **P&L fix location**: Line 1198-1206 (`close_position` function)\n- **Rotation code location**: Lines 2394-2424 (roughly)\n- **Trade data at 17:38**: 104 total trades, +96.14 USDT cumulative; current floating at restart: +5.16 (SOL +2.48, LINK +3.35, BTC -0.67); XRP closed; BNB auto-opened after XRP close\n- **Net P&L at 17:39**: +1.49 USDT (after XRP close)\n- **GitHub repo**: `https://github.com/yuki39lhl-huang/Morgan.git` (private), commit `eabbb4f` pushed\n- **Proxy**: `127.0.0.1:7890` for both HTTP and HTTPS\n- **User IDs**: sender `ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`, group `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Goal\n用户质疑为什么仓位没有满（4个）却触发了轮换交易，要求排查轮换逻辑是否正确。\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 查看监控日志，确认 19:34 轮换时 API 返回了 4 个持仓（SOL, BNB, LINK, BTC），满仓条件满足\n- [x] 确认轮换逻辑：LINK SHORT（65分）替换了最弱的 SOL（10分）\n- [x] SOL 已成功平仓\n- [x] 发现 LINK SHORT 开仓时抛异常 `⚠️ 轮换异常：'float' object has no attribute 'get'`，导致 LINK SHORT 未成功开仓\n- [x] 查询当前真实持仓：3 个（BNB LONG, LINK LONG, BTC SHORT），无 LINK SHORT\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 排查轮换异常 `'float' object has no attribute 'get'` 的具体代码位置与根因\n- [ ] 检查同币种不同方向（LINK LONG 与 LINK SHORT）是否被重复持仓检测拦截——当前结论是轮换开仓阶段就崩溃了，未到重复检测逻辑\n\n### Blocked\n- (无)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- 尚未做出最终决策，仍在排查阶段\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 定位轮换代码中 `'float' object has no attribute 'get'` 的抛出位置并修复\n2. 确认重复持仓检测逻辑是否能正确处理“同一币种已存在反向仓位”的场景\n3. 修复后重新验证轮换流程\n\n## Critical Context\n- 监控日志路径: 