{"type":"message","id":"19ec47a0","parentId":"ebce2595","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:16:13.901Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_aMlOTKVIqUvJ2oLpW04d8007","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-05-29 日志\n\n## 策略优化任务计划\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n- **仓位反转数量修复**：crypto_signal_monitor.py L2232，反转重建持仓时改为按风控规则重算数量，不再用 API 的 abs(amt)\n\n### 📋 待执行（优先级排序）\n\n#### P0 - SOL 限制\n- SOL 29笔/-9.45U，频率最高亏损最大\n- 方案：信号冷却从 3min → 10min，或评分阈值 +10\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 冷却逻辑 / 评分阈值\n\n#### P1 - BTC 下单精度\n- BTC 0.0028 拆成 6 笔碎单，未按 3 位精度合并\n- 方案：`format_quantity` 对 BTC 使用 3 位小数\n- 文件：`binance_auto_trade.py` format_quantity 函数\n\n#### P2 - 仓位轮换机制\n- 46 次开仓因满仓被挡，好信号进不来\n- 方案：持仓满 4 时，新信号评分高出最低持仓 20 分以上，自动平最差的换新的\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 开仓闸门\n\n#### P3 - 盈亏计算修正（待做）\n- 非标仓位盈亏按标准仓位算 → 数字虚高\n- 方案：盈亏按实际持仓数量 × 价格差计算\n- 文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 盈亏计算函数\n\n---\n\n## 执行进度 (17:23)\n\n### ✅ P0 — SOL 限频（已改，未重启）\n- 配置新增 `signal_cooldown.per_symbol.SOL = 600`（10分钟）\n- 配置新增 `score_threshold.per_symbol_bonus.SOL = 10`（门槛+10分）\n- `CooldownManager.can_open` 改为优先读取 per_symbol 覆盖\n- `calc_score` 阈值检查加入 per_symbol_bonus\n\n### ⏭️ P1 — BTC 下单精度（跳过）\n- BTC 精度配置已正确（3位），碎单是 Binance 市价单正常撮合行为，非 bug\n\n### ✅ P2 — 仓位轮换（已改，未重启）\n- 满仓时不再直接 break，改为评估新旧信号\n- 新信号评分 ≥ 最弱持仓 + 20 分 → 平最弱开新的\n- 不达标则记录日志跳过\n\n### ✅ GitHub Push\n- Commit `eabbb4f` push 成功\n- git 配置添加了 http.proxy / https.proxy = 127.0.0.1:7890\n- ⚠️ Token `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` 已暴露在exec命令中，建议 revoke\n\n### 📊 当日战绩（16:01 数据）\n- 总成交 104 笔，累计已实现 +96.14 USDT\n- 盈利品种：ETH +30.95, DOT +28.59, BTC +25.50, XRP +17.29, BNB +5.63\n- 亏损品种：SOL -9.45, LINK -1.76, ETC -0.60\n- 当前持仓(17:14)：4仓满，浮动+3.19，净亏-0.49\n\n### ⏳ 待重启\n- P0 + P2 代码已改，语法检查通过，等待 kj 重启生效\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780064173880}}
{"type":"message","id":"15e0cb21","parentId":"19ec47a0","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:16:33.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The existing memory file already has content up to the GitHub push and pre-restart state. Now I need to append the significant events from this session turn:\n\n1. P2 Rotation bug found: `close_result.get(\"success\")` crashed because `close_position` returns float PnL, not dict\n2. SOL was successfully closed but LINK SHORT failed to open due to this bug\n3. Fixed: changed check to `isinstance(close_result, (int, float))`\n4. Removed unused `LEVERAGE = 10` dead variable\n5. Added `sym_in_positions` check to prevent rotation when new signal's symbol already has a position\n6. Rotation was too aggressive - DOT swapped 3 times in 9 minutes (21:03-21:12)\n7. Added minimum hold time (600s) for new positions, but then user decided to just revert P2 entirely\n8. P2 rotation completely reverted - back to simple break on full\n9. P0 (SOL cooldown) and P3 (PnL fix) kept\n10. Rotation caused havoc before being killed: LINK, SOL, XRP were swapped at 21:28\n11. Post-restart: 3 positions (DOT SHORT, XRP SHORT, BTC SHORT), clean logs, no errors\n12. Net PnL at 22:01: floating -1.30, realized -2.59, net -3.89 USDT\n\nLet me append this to the memory file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_oDXhY0RHrsiNGSb95JUc8121","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-29.md","old_string":"### ⏳ 待重启\n- P0 + P2 代码已改，语法检查通过，等待 kj 重启生效","new_string":"### ⏳ 待重启\n- P0 + P2 代码已改，语法检查通过，等待 kj 重启生效\n\n---\n\n## P2 轮换机制 bug 修复与最终回滚 (19:34-21:52)\n\n### Bug 1：close_position 返回值类型错误\n- `close_position()` 返回 float（PnL），轮换代码写了 `close_result.get(\"success\")` → 崩溃\n- 19:34 SOL 被成功平仓（+0.48U），但 LINK SHORT 因异常被 skip，没开成\n- 修复：`isinstance(close_result, (int, float))` 替代 `.get(\"success\")`\n- 同时清理了无用的 `LEVERAGE = 10` 死变量\n\n### Bug 2：同币种轮换盲区\n- LINK 已有 LONG，轮换仍平 SOL 尝试开 LINK SHORT，被重复检测拦截 → 白平一个仓位\n- 修复：新增 `sym_in_positions` 检查，轮换前判新信号币种是否已在持仓\n\n### Bug 3：频繁换手（Ping-Pong）\n- 21:03 BNB(10)→DOT(80) ✅ / 21:09 DOT(40)→BTC(65) / 21:12 ETH(50)→DOT(80)\n- DOT 9 分钟内被开关 3 次，手续费吃掉 ~1.2U\n- 加过最小持仓时间保护（600s），但用户决定回滚\n\n### 最终决策：完全撤掉 P2 轮换\n- 21:37 用户指示撤掉轮换，回到原始 break 逻辑\n- P0（SOL 限频）和 P3（盈亏修正）保留\n- 21:28 旧代码最后搞了一次破坏：LINK LONG(-0.12U)、XRP(-0.00)、SOL(+0.17U) 被换\n- 重启后 3 仓：DOT SHORT / XRP SHORT / BTC SHORT，日志干净零报错\n\n### 💰 当日收盘数据（22:01）\n- 浮动盈亏：-1.30 USDT\n- 已实现：-2.59 USDT\n- 净盈亏：-3.89 USDT"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":893,"output":1260,"cacheRead":51712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53865,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780064173907}}
