{"type":"message","id":"a0447f4a","parentId":"7a2078dc","timestamp":"2026-05-29T14:48:36.851Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The news is mostly neutral to bearish:\n\n1. CoinDesk 20 index down, TAO -4% (bearish for alts)\n2. Paxos gets SEC approval for blockchain stock settlement (neutral/bullish for crypto infra)\n3. Hyperliquid bigger than NASDAQ claim (neutral/sentiment)\n4. Bitcoin underperforming, 9th day of ETF outflows (bearish)\n5. Bitcoin ETF outflows record 9-day streak, $2.8B pulled (bearish)\n\nOverall market sentiment: bearish, ETF outflows continuing, Bitcoin underperforming. This explains the low scores — market is sluggish with no clear direction but some bearish undercurrent from ETF outflows.\n\nLet me summarize this cleanly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"大环境偏空，BTC ETF 连续 9 天净流出：\n\n- 🔴 CoinDesk 20 指数下跌，TAO -4%\n- 🔴 BTC ETF 连续 9 天流出，累计 28 亿美元\n- 🔴 比特币跑输其他风险资产\n- ⚪ Paxos 获 SEC 批准做区块链清算（中性利好）\n- ⚪ Hyperliquid 被 ICE CEO 吹成\"比纳斯达克还大\"（喊单）\n\n市场软绵绵的，难怪信号全废。不过咱们现在 3 个空单（DOT/XRP/BTC）方向没错 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":655,"output":448,"cacheRead":55936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57039,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780066108669}}
