{"type":"message","id":"045dfa09","parentId":"78c10855","timestamp":"2026-05-29T16:04:34.936Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_uq4htiTQCTn4ycEPs2yz7027","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                        if should_trigger_ai:\n                            ai_result = ai_predictor.predict(sym, direction, ind, pd, fg_cache)\n                        else:\n                            ai_result = None  # 纯数学决策\n                            log.info(f\"🤖 {sym} 跳过 AI（评分{score}分，纯数学决策）\")\n\n                        # AI与数学信号冲突时降级观望\n                        if ai_result:\n                            ai_dir = ai_result.get(\"direction\", \"\")\n                            conflict = (\n                                (direction == \"LONG\"  and ai_dir in [\"做空\", \"震荡\"]) or\n                                (direction == \"SHORT\" and ai_dir in [\"做多\", \"震荡\"])\n                            )\n                            if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70:\n                                log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI与数学信号冲突，观望\")\n                                continue\n\n                        # 开仓前再次检查持仓数（双重保险）\n                        # 🐛 Bug 修复：API 是真相，本地是缓存\n                        current_pos = get_all_positions()\n                        api_count = sum(1 for p in current_pos if float(p.get(\"amount\", 0)) != 0)\n                        local_count = len(positions)\n                        \n                        # API 有数据时相信 API，否则用本地\n                        if api_count > 0:\n                            actual_count = api_count + opened_this_loop\n                        else:\n                            actual_count = local_count + opened_this_loop\n                        \n                        if actual_count >= CONFIG[\"max_positions\"]:\n\n[64 more lines in file. Use offset=2460 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780070674920}}
{"type":"message","id":"f3ed3e97","parentId":"045dfa09","timestamp":"2026-05-29T16:04:55.790Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found the bug! Lines 2437-2444:\n\n```python\nif ai_result:\n    ai_dir = ai_result.get(\"direction\", \"\")\n    conflict = (\n        (direction == \"LONG\"  and ai_dir in [\"做空\", \"震荡\"]) or\n        (direction == \"SHORT\" and ai_dir in [\"做多\", \"震荡\"])\n    )\n    if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70:\n        log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI与数学信号冲突，观望\")\n        continue\n```\n\nThe condition is: `conflict AND confidence > 70`\n\nWhen AI says \"震荡\" with 0% confidence:\n- conflict = True (AI says 震荡, direction is SHORT)\n- confidence = 0, which is NOT > 70\n- So: True AND False = False → doesn't skip, TRADES ANYWAY!\n\nThe condition should be EITHER:\n1. `if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) >= 0` — skip on ANY confidence when AI conflicts\n2. Or `if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70` should be `if conflict` — skip even when confidence is low\n\nThe current logic is backwards. When AI has HIGH confidence and disagrees, it skips. But when AI has LOW confidence and disagrees, it trades. This is wrong — low confidence disagreement should still skip, or even more so!\n\nActually wait, let me think about the intent here. The original idea was probably: \"If AI disagrees WITH HIGH CONFIDENCE, skip. If AI disagrees with low confidence, trust math.\" But when AI says \"震荡\" (sideways) with 0 confidence, that's still a disagreement — and the AI is effectively saying \"no direction, don't trade.\"\n\nThe fix should be: when AI says \"震荡\" (sideways), ALWAYS skip regardless of confidence. \"震荡\" means no clear direction, which is different from conflicting with a specific direction.\n\nActually, the simplest and most correct fix: if AI says \"震荡\", skip regardless of confidence. Even 0% confidence on \"sideways\" means AI doesn't see a trade.\n\n```python\nif conflict and (ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70 or ai_dir == \"震荡\"):\n    log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI与数学信号冲突，观望\")\n    continue\n```\n\nOr even simpler: just remove the confidence threshold for \"震荡\":\n```python\nif conflict and (ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70 or ai_dir == \"震荡\"):\n```\n\nHmm, but actually, the broader issue is: should we skip when AI disagrees even with low confidence? I think the original intent was \"if AI disagrees with conviction, override math.\" But maybe we should just always skip when AI disagrees.\n\nLet me keep it simple and fix just the \"震荡\" case, which is what's causing the damage:\n- AI says 震荡 = no direction = don't trade\n- AI says opposite direction with high confidence = skip (existing)\n- AI says opposite direction with low confidence = trade anyway (existing, ok)\n\nLet me change it so 震荡 always → skip.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到根因了 👑\n\n```python\nif conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70:  # ← 这里！\n```\n\n当 AI 说「震荡 + 0% 信心」时：\n- `conflict` = True（方向不对）\n- `confidence > 70` = **False**（0 不大于 70）\n- 结果：**不跳过，照开！**\n\nAI 喊「方向不明别开」，系统因为 AI 信心太低反而不听它的。逻辑写反了——震荡应该无条件观望："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Ndj920UjgWEJoDMOD2FX2162","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"                            if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70:\n                                log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI与数学信号冲突，观望\")\n                                continue","new_string":"                            # 🐛 修复：AI 说震荡 → 无条件观望；AI 反向 + 高信心 → 观望\n                            if ai_dir == \"震荡\":\n                                log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI判断震荡市，观望（数学={direction}，AI=震荡）\")\n                                continue\n                            if conflict and ai_result.get(\"confidence\", 0) > 70:\n                                log.info(f\"⏸️ {sym} AI与数学信号冲突({ai_result.get('confidence')}%)，观望\")\n                                continue"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":446,"output":1725,"cacheRead":64512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66683,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780070674955}}
