{"type":"message","id":"9897f766","parentId":"9bf889da","timestamp":"2026-05-29T16:46:02.469Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - the restart worked. The AI震荡 fix is active:\n\n1. ETH at 00:44 - AI said 震荡 → skipped (\"观望\") ✅\n2. ETH at 00:45 - AI said 做空, 70% confidence, math says LONG → 冲突\n   - Math: LONG, AI: 做空, confidence: 70\n   - conflict = (LONG and AI=\"做空\") = True\n   - confidence 70 > 70? No, 70 is not > 70. So it didn't skip and opened LONG!\n\nWait, that's borderline. The condition is `> 70`, and confidence is exactly 70. So it didn't trigger the conflict skip, and the trade went through.\n\nHmm, should I change it to `>= 70`? 70 is the threshold from the strategy. Let me just report what happened.\n\nActually looking more carefully, the AI said 做空 with 70% confidence, the math said LONG. They're in direct conflict with decent confidence. It should have skipped.\n\nLet me check: the condition is `confidence > 70`, AI returned confidence=70. 70 > 70 = False, so the conflict check didn't fire. \n\nI should change to `>= 70`. But maybe I should also just let the user know. Let me just report the logs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"生效了 👑 ETH 刚刚触发了两次：\n\n- 00:44 AI 说震荡 → **拦住了** ✅\n- 00:45 AI 说做空 70%信心，数学说做多 → 冲突了但开了多单，因为 70 = 70 刚好没过 `>70` 的线\n\n要把 `>70` 改成 `>=70` 吗？这样就严格一致，AI 反向 ≥70% 全拦。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":421,"output":673,"cacheRead":66688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67782,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780073152104}}
